[[:db/add "3323e206-9772-52e7-95d1-ae555a2267d8" :answer/id #uuid "3323e206-9772-52e7-95d1-ae555a2267d8"] [:db/add "3323e206-9772-52e7-95d1-ae555a2267d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3323e206-9772-52e7-95d1-ae555a2267d8" :answer/value "\\left(-2,0,1\\right)"] [:db/ensure "3323e206-9772-52e7-95d1-ae555a2267d8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b3055e57-9904-5a83-8358-2b14218d350d" :answer/id #uuid "b3055e57-9904-5a83-8358-2b14218d350d"] [:db/add "b3055e57-9904-5a83-8358-2b14218d350d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b3055e57-9904-5a83-8358-2b14218d350d" :answer/value "\\left(-8,-2,-1\\right)"] [:db/ensure "b3055e57-9904-5a83-8358-2b14218d350d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c7cd0788-9e2f-51a7-a847-331faa12c136" :answer/id #uuid "c7cd0788-9e2f-51a7-a847-331faa12c136"] [:db/add "c7cd0788-9e2f-51a7-a847-331faa12c136" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c7cd0788-9e2f-51a7-a847-331faa12c136" :answer/value "\\left(0,2,-1\\right)"] [:db/ensure "c7cd0788-9e2f-51a7-a847-331faa12c136" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8fdad44b-bde0-5b46-8672-ca0c1f7f6127" :answer/id #uuid "8fdad44b-bde0-5b46-8672-ca0c1f7f6127"] [:db/add "8fdad44b-bde0-5b46-8672-ca0c1f7f6127" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8fdad44b-bde0-5b46-8672-ca0c1f7f6127" :answer/value "\\left(-4,-1,1\\right)"] [:db/ensure "8fdad44b-bde0-5b46-8672-ca0c1f7f6127" :answer/validate] [:db/add "47180298-2284-5003-8009-4ab8e41d3b44" :answer/id #uuid "47180298-2284-5003-8009-4ab8e41d3b44"] [:db/add "47180298-2284-5003-8009-4ab8e41d3b44" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "47180298-2284-5003-8009-4ab8e41d3b44" :answer/value "\\left(2,2,1\\right)"] [:db/ensure "47180298-2284-5003-8009-4ab8e41d3b44" :answer/validate] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/id #uuid "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597"] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/choices "3323e206-9772-52e7-95d1-ae555a2267d8"] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/choices "b3055e57-9904-5a83-8358-2b14218d350d"] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/choices "c7cd0788-9e2f-51a7-a847-331faa12c136"] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/choices "8fdad44b-bde0-5b46-8672-ca0c1f7f6127"] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/choices "47180298-2284-5003-8009-4ab8e41d3b44"] [:db/add "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/correct "8fdad44b-bde0-5b46-8672-ca0c1f7f6127"] [:db/ensure "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603" :question/id #uuid "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603"] [:db/add "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ for the variables $x,y,z$ in that order.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system. Select the solution $(x,y,z)$."] [:db/add "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_2:=R_2+(1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 0 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_3:=R_3+(-1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe second pivot is zero, while the third row has a nonzero second entry. Exchange $R_2$ and $R_3$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThus the row echelon matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nBack substitute, starting with the last row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z &=1 \\\\ y &=0-(1)(1) \\\\ &=-1 \\\\ x &=-3-(-2)(-1) \\\\ &\\quad -(-1)(1) \\\\ &=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution $(x,y,z)$ is\n\n$$\n\\left(-4,-1,1\\right)\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603" :question/answer-fields "279aecc0-5469-5835-a1c8-143797813597"] [:db/ensure "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096673 :knowledge-point/questions "89e0ec45-c6c5-510c-8d5d-815a56ed5603"] [:db/add "c3ab1247-07bd-5322-a945-5a49ce8f23f0" :answer/id #uuid "c3ab1247-07bd-5322-a945-5a49ce8f23f0"] [:db/add "c3ab1247-07bd-5322-a945-5a49ce8f23f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c3ab1247-07bd-5322-a945-5a49ce8f23f0" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "c3ab1247-07bd-5322-a945-5a49ce8f23f0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f0aaf925-d31c-5310-83f4-238bc96b94be" :answer/id #uuid "f0aaf925-d31c-5310-83f4-238bc96b94be"] [:db/add "f0aaf925-d31c-5310-83f4-238bc96b94be" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f0aaf925-d31c-5310-83f4-238bc96b94be" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "f0aaf925-d31c-5310-83f4-238bc96b94be" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7ebe8c82-9ef6-5fe6-806a-7791c7d71a5b" :answer/id #uuid "7ebe8c82-9ef6-5fe6-806a-7791c7d71a5b"] [:db/add "7ebe8c82-9ef6-5fe6-806a-7791c7d71a5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7ebe8c82-9ef6-5fe6-806a-7791c7d71a5b" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "7ebe8c82-9ef6-5fe6-806a-7791c7d71a5b" :answer/validate] [:db