291ce81" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ for the variables $x,y,z$ in that order.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form. Select the resulting augmented matrix."] [:db/add "35620eb4-8eca-5e74-b2ba-81cd6291ce81" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_2:=R_2+(-1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe second pivot is zero, while the third row has a nonzero second entry. Exchange $R_2$ and $R_3$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThus the row echelon matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "35620eb4-8eca-5e74-b2ba-81cd6291ce81" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "35620eb4-8eca-5e74-b2ba-81cd6291ce81" :question/answer-fields "230f4e15-6c54-52f2-a5b7-6092f71756a9"] [:db/ensure "35620eb4-8eca-5e74-b2ba-81cd6291ce81" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096673 :knowledge-point/questions "35620eb4-8eca-5e74-b2ba-81cd6291ce81"] [:db/add "857cfca3-97dc-55dc-b2b8-99516cb7691e" :answer/id #uuid "857cfca3-97dc-55dc-b2b8-99516cb7691e"] [:db/add "857cfca3-97dc-55dc-b2b8-99516cb7691e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "857cfca3-97dc-55dc-b2b8-99516cb7691e" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "857cfca3-97dc-55dc-b2b8-99516cb7691e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "64a678ea-d625-558d-8043-513b5dfdec2b" :answer/id #uuid "64a678ea-d625-558d-8043-513b5dfdec2b"] [:db/add "64a678ea-d625-558d