wer-field/choices "64a678ea-d625-558d-8043-513b5dfdec2b"] [:db/add "46bbdd16-28f5-58aa-97ec-56b64f2e8cc4" :answer-field/choices "3412d9b0-6ed3-5a0e-8dd3-cb41a217534e"] [:db/add "46bbdd16-28f5-58aa-97ec-56b64f2e8cc4" :answer-field/choices "f39f8a58-9e36-5c09-b0ad-618d760e694a"] [:db/add "46bbdd16-28f5-58aa-97ec-56b64f2e8cc4" :answer-field/choices "6cfa7ff9-ed5d-58c3-9eca-a8bd6f62fecf"] [:db/add "46bbdd16-28f5-58aa-97ec-56b64f2e8cc4" :answer-field/correct "6cfa7ff9-ed5d-58c3-9eca-a8bd6f62fecf"] [:db/ensure "46bbdd16-28f5-58aa-97ec-56b64f2e8cc4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97" :question/id #uuid "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97"] [:db/add "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ for the variables $x,y,z$ in that order.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form. Select the resulting augmented matrix."] [:db/add "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_2:=R_2+(-1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe second pivot is zero, while the third row has a nonzero second entry. Exchange $R_2$ and $R_3$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThus the row echelon matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97" :question/answer-fields "46bbdd16-28f5-58aa-97ec-56b64f2e8cc4"] [:db/ensure "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096673 :knowledge-point/questions "b3aa6852-8fd9-5b62-b111-a565aa99ad97"] [:db/add "335825d2-825f-5b0d-afed-49bdae0de665" :answer/id #uuid "335825d2-825f-5b0d-afed-49bdae0de665"] [:db/add "335825d2-825f-5b0d-afed-49bdae0de665" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "335825d2-825f-5b0d-afed-49bdae0de665" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "335825d2-825f-5b0d-afed-49bdae0de665" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2e4786fc-1312-5d21-9014-67b4addda47a" :answer/id #uuid "2e4786fc-1312-5d21-9014-67b4addda47a"] [:db/add "2e4786fc-1312-5d21-9014-67b4addda47a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2e4786fc-1312-5d21-9014-67b4addda47a" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "2e4786fc-1312-5d21-9014-67b4addda47a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ae3e9147-5673-5527-aed3-137284f7aa48" :answer/id #uuid "ae3e9147-5673-5527-aed3-137284f7aa48"] [:db/add "ae3e9147-5673-5527-aed3-137284f7aa48" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ae3e9147-5673-5527-aed3-137284f7aa48" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "ae3e9147-5673-5527-aed3-137284f7aa48" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1e6633a2-0bf0-570c-abb2-a0b3ca210ff4" :answer/id #uuid "1e6633a2-0bf0-570c-abb2-a0b3ca210ff4"] [:db/add "1e6633a2-0bf0-570c-abb2-a0b3ca210ff4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1e6633a2-0bf0-570c-abb2-a0b3ca210ff4" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "1e6633a2-0bf0-570c-abb2-a0b3ca210ff4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "829bb97e-9253-5577-9416-ca4747e7572a" :answer/id #uuid "829bb97e-9253-5577-9416-ca4747e7572a"] [:db/add "829bb97e-9253-5577-9416-ca4747e7572a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "829bb97e-9253-5577-9416-ca4747e7572a" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "829bb97e-9253-5577-9416-ca4747e7572a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/id #uuid "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284"] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/choices "335825d2-825f-5b0d-afed-49bdae0de665"] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/choices "2e4786fc-1312-5d21-9014-67b4addda47a"] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/choices "ae3e9147-5673-5527-aed3-137284f7aa48"] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/choices "1e6633a2-0bf0-570c-abb2-a0b3ca210ff4"] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/choices "829bb97e-9253-5577-9416-ca4747e7572a"] [:db/add "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/correct "ae3e9147-5673-5527-aed3-137284f7aa48"] [:db/ensure "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc" :question/id #uuid "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc"] [:db/add "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-1 \\\\ x+2y+z &=0 \\\\ x+3y &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form. Select the resulting augmented matrix."] [:db/add "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_2:=R_2+(-1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_3:=R_3+(-1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe second pivot is zero, while the third row has a nonzero second entry. Exchange $R_2$ and $R_3$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThus the row echelon matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc" :question/answer-fields "e9a5aa58-f2dd-5b88-8bcd-9828b00a4284"] [:db/ensure "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096673 :knowledge-point/questions "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc"] [:db/add "19c616fd-6599-5590-99c4-b6f696a8b547" :answer/id #uuid "19c616fd-6599-5590-99c4-b6f696a8b547"] [:db/add "19c616fd-6599-5590-99c4-b6f696a8b547" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "19c616fd-6599-5590-99c4-b6f696a8b547" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "19c616fd-6599-5590-99c4-b6f696a8b547" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2bbf8613-45dd-5a01-9485-6cf0a8e860c9" :answer/id #uuid "2bbf8613-45dd-5a01-9485-6cf0a8e860c9"] [:db/add "2bbf8613-45dd-5a01-9485-6cf0a8e860c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2bbf8613-45dd-5a01-9485-6cf0a8e860c9" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "2bbf8613-45dd-5a01-9485-6cf0a8e860c9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c47564a1-d985-5f57-a2f1-316c37ab2fbc" :answer/id #uuid "c47564a1-d985-5f57-a2f1-316c37ab2fbc"] [:db/add "c47564a1-d985-5f57-a2f1-316c37ab2fbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c47564a1-d985-5f57-a2f1-316c37ab2fbc" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "c47564a1-d985-5f57-a2f1-316c37ab2fbc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0d495234-2e3e-5458-87b9-b336f5b0be19" :answer/id #uuid "0d495234-2e3e-5458-87b9-b336f5b0be19"] [:db/add "0d495234-2e3e-5458-87b9-b336f5b0be19" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0d495234-2e3e-5458-87b9-b336f5b0be19" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "0d495234-2e3e-5458-87b9-b336f5b0be19" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c9962142-c900-5e72-bec2-3c6fedbe5a4f" :answer/id #uuid "c9962142-c900-5e72-bec2-3c6fedbe5a4f"] [:db/add "c9962142-c900-5e72-bec2-3c6fedbe5a4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c9962142-c900-5e72-bec2-3c6fedbe5a4f" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "c9962142-c900-5e72-bec2-3c6fedbe5a4f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/id #uuid "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5"] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/choices "19c616fd-6599-5590-99c4-b6f696a8b547"] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/choices "2bbf8613-45dd-5a01-9485-6cf0a8e860c9"] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/choices "c47564a1-d985-5f57-a2f1-316c37ab2fbc"] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/choices "0d495234-2e3e-5458-87b9-b336f5b0be19"] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/choices "c9962142-c900-5e72-bec2-3c6fedbe5a4f"] [:db/add "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/correct "19c616fd-6599-5590-99c4-b6f696a8b547"] [:db/ensure "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d" :question/id #uuid "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d"] [:db/add "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y &=-2 \\\\ -x-y+z &=2 \\\\ -x+z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form. Select the resulting augmented matrix."] [:db/add "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_2:=R_2+(1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_3:=R_3+(1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe second pivot is zero, while the third row has a nonzero second entry. Exchange $R_2$ and $R_3$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThus the row echelon matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d" :question/answer-fields "dca850b4-48c3-5374-b3d5-13708a6a82c5"] [:db/ensure "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096673 :knowledge-point/questions "58d0bd61-a83b-523f-8c51-2fd462725b4d"] [:db/ensure 17592186096673 :knowledge-point/validate]]
